[TITLE]
synthetic: lidnode::validate over NODE stacks (order, parameters, Richards) and adapted
BC/PP/RG/IT/GR controls on storage nodes, with MaxDepth checks

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CFS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE
QUALITY_SOLVER LEGACY

[POLLUTANTS]
TSS MG/L 0 0 0 0 NO * 0 0 0

[STORAGE]
N_good 0 2.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_depth 0 3.0 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_close 0 2.50000001 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_badorder 0 1.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_empty 0 1.0 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_rich 0 2.0 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_richns 0 1.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_richmiss 0 2.0 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_richres 0 1.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_bio 0 2.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_bio0 0 2.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_pave 0 1.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_rain 0 1.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_trench 0 2.5 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_roof 0 1.0 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_neg 0 1.0 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0
N_plain 0 1.0 0 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 1000 0 0

[LID_CONTROLS]
Good NODE
Good SURFACE 6 .1
Good MEDIA 12 .45 .20 .08 5 3 3
Good AGGREGATE 12 .40 100
Good BOTTOM 0.5 0
BadOrder NODE
BadOrder MEDIA 12 .45 .20 .08 5 3 3
BadOrder SURFACE 6 .1
BadBottom NODE
BadBottom SURFACE 6 .1
BadBottom BOTTOM 0 0
BadBottom AGGREGATE 12 .40 100
NoPorous NODE
NoPorous SURFACE 6 .1
NoPorous BOTTOM 0 0
Empty NODE
BadMedia NODE
BadMedia SURFACE 6 .1
BadMedia MEDIA 12 .30 .40 .08 5 3 3
BadSurface NODE
BadSurface SURFACE 6 1.0
BadSurface AGGREGATE 12 .40 100
Negative NODE
Negative AGGREGATE -1 .40 100
TwoSurf NODE
TwoSurf SURFACE 6 .1
TwoSurf SURFACE 6 .1
TwoSurf AGGREGATE 12 .40 100
Rich NODE
Rich SURFACE 6 .1
Rich MEDIA 12 .45 .2 .08 2 10 3
Rich AGGREGATE 6 .4 100
Rich BOTTOM .5 0
RichNoSurface NODE
RichNoSurface MEDIA 12 .45 .2 .08 2 10 3
RichNoSurface AGGREGATE 6 .4 100
RichMissing NODE
RichMissing SURFACE 6 .1
RichMissing MEDIA 12 .45 .2 .08 2 10 3
RichMissing AGGREGATE 6 .4 100
RichResidual NODE
RichResidual SURFACE 6 .1
RichResidual MEDIA 12 .45 .2 .08 2 10 3
Bio BC
Bio SURFACE 6 0.1 0.1 1.0 5
Bio SOIL 12 0.5 0.2 0.1 0.5 10 3.5
Bio STORAGE 12 0.75 0.5 0
Bio DRAIN 0.5 0.5 6 6 0 0
Bio0 BC
Bio0 SURFACE 6 0.1 0 0 0
Bio0 SOIL 12 0.5 0.2 0.1 0.5 10 3.5
Bio0 STORAGE 12 0.75 0.5 0
Pave PP
Pave SURFACE 0 0 0.1 1.0 0
Pave PAVEMENT 6 0.15 0.2 100 3
Pave SOIL 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
Pave STORAGE 12 0.75 0.5 0
Rain RG
Rain SURFACE 6 0 0 0 0
Rain SOIL 12 0.5 0.2 0.1 0.5 10 3.5
Rain STORAGE 0 0 0 0
Trench IT
Trench SURFACE 6 0 0 0 0
Trench STORAGE 24 0.75 0.5 0
Roof GR
Roof SURFACE 6 0 0 0 0
Roof SOIL 6 0.5 0.2 0.1 0.5 10 3.5

[LID_RICHARDS]
Rich OPTIONS 4 1e-7 1e-5 30
Rich 2 .03 2 1.6 .5 .0001
Rich 3 .03 2 1.6 .5 .0001
RichNoSurface OPTIONS 4 1e-7 1e-5 30
RichNoSurface 1 .03 2 1.6 .5 .0001
RichNoSurface 2 .03 2 1.6 .5 .0001
RichMissing OPTIONS 4 1e-7 1e-5 30
RichMissing 2 .03 2 1.6 .5 .0001
RichResidual OPTIONS 4 1e-7 1e-5 30
RichResidual 2 .1 2 1.6 .5 .0001

[LID_LAYER_TREATMENT]
Good 2 TSS 50 0.5 C = 0.5*C
Good 3 TSS 10 0 -

[LID_NODES]
N_good Good 10
N_depth Good 10
N_close Good 10
N_badorder BadOrder 0
N_empty Empty 0
N_rich Rich 20
N_richns RichNoSurface 20
N_richmiss RichMissing 20
N_richres RichResidual 20
N_bio Bio 0
N_bio0 Bio0 0
N_pave Pave 0
N_rain Rain 0
N_trench Trench 0
N_roof Roof 0
N_neg Negative 0
